      "help_en": "The display name of the snapshot. The name must be 2 to 128 characters in length. It must start with a letter or a Chinese character and cannot start with `http://` or `https://`. The name can contain English or Chinese characters, digits, colons (:), underscores (_), and hyphens (-).\n\nTo prevent conflicts with automatic snapshot names, the name cannot start with auto or dbfs-auto",
      "help_zh": "快照的显示名称。长度为2~128个英文或中文字符。必须以大小字母或中文开头，不能以`http://`和`https://`开头。可以包含数字、半角冒号（:）、下划线（_）或者连字符（-）。\n\n为防止和自动快照的名称冲突，不能以auto开头和dbfs-auto开头",
